# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# B1: HMAC chain integrity under concurrent writes
# SessionAuditSequencer provides per-session ReentrantLock to prevent
# TOCTOU race on sequence + prevHash. Before the fix: two concurrent
# tool calls on the same session could read the same MAX(sequence),
# both write sequence+1, permanently forking the chain.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [B1-SETUP] Create session for concurrent audit test
# @name b1Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [B1-SEED] Run multiple quick tasks to generate several audit rows
### These run sequentially in this file but the important test is
### concurrent cron tasks or parallel tool calls in real usage.

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}
{"goal": "What is 1+1?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}
{"goal": "What is 2+2?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}
{"goal": "What is 3+3?", "agentRole": "coordinator", "maxIterations": 1}

###

### [B1-VERIFY] HMAC chain must be unbroken after multiple writes
# Before the fix: concurrent writes could produce duplicate sequence numbers,
# breaking the chain. After fix: SessionAuditSequencer serialises per-session.
# Expect: {"valid": true, "brokenAtId": null, "totalRows": N}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}/verify
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### [B1-LIST] Verify no duplicate sequence numbers in audit rows
# All sequence values must be unique and consecutive starting from 1.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{b1Session.response.body.sessionId}}
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###


