# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# C3: RAG chunks stored in rag_chunk table, not "rag:" prefix in compaction_summary
# After the fix: IngestDocumentTool writes to rag_chunk, not compaction_summary.
# Compaction summaries and RAG chunks are fully separated.
