Content-Type: application/json
X-Amsha-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Ingest this document: Amsha Agent Phase 64 introduces rag_chunk table, SessionRegistry, ChannelCronNotificationDispatcher, and fixes budget enforcement ordering.",
